[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16560.15, "timestamp": "04:36:00", "text": "私たちの間では、ええと、それは趣味です。私たちのほとんどは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16563.83, "timestamp": "04:36:03", "text": "ええ、深刻なものを2つ見たことがありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16565.99, "timestamp": "04:36:05", "text": "このコメディにはまだ人がいないけど、うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16568.15, "timestamp": "04:36:08", "text": "ほとんどは趣味みたいなものですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16570.91, "timestamp": "04:36:10", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16573.629, "timestamp": "04:36:13", "text": "ああ、ありがとう、ジャニス。ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16578.47, "timestamp": "04:36:18", "text": "贈り物、シャ。ありがとう。ああ、そうだね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16581.15, "timestamp": "04:36:21", "text": "そんなことが起きたら、私はひどく落ち込むだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16585.109, "timestamp": "04:36:25", "text": "でも、それを必ず出すようにします"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16585.755, "timestamp": "04:36:25", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I trusted them with everything :) "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16589.189, "timestamp": "04:36:29", "text": "明らかに明らかに理解されている、もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16591.75, "timestamp": "04:36:31", "text": "あなたは私にそれをするつもりですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16595.029, "timestamp": "04:36:35", "text": "物事は私に影響を与え、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16597.67, "timestamp": "04:36:37", "text": "そういう行動を容認する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16602.23, "timestamp": "04:36:42", "text": "だって、いや、君の場合は、君の場合は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16604.269, "timestamp": "04:36:44", "text": "大丈夫、理解する必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16607.869, "timestamp": "04:36:47", "text": "あなたは企業の傘下にある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16609.39, "timestamp": "04:36:49", "text": "環境。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16612.949, "timestamp": "04:36:52", "text": "だから、あなたが構築したオーディエンスと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16615.59, "timestamp": "04:36:55", "text": "すべては常に共有されます"}]